CPT EXCLUSION (AMA)
-------------------
CPT is excluded entirely from every artifact this service serves. The AMA
license (category 3) forbids use of CPT content "in publicly accessible
systems". Both the terminology release (without-cpt variant, attested in
its manifest.json) and lookup.duckdb (verified: zero SAB='CPT' rows, zero
edges touching CPT atoms) contain no CPT codes, names, or derived text.

